{"modifiedFiles":[],"workingNote":"まず既存のプロトコル実装とテストを確認し、kindleBoth の既存操作パターン・状態表現・公開シグネチャを維持したまま実装します。"}{"modifiedFiles":[{"path":"src/protocol_adapter.ts","content":"export type WorldStateHandle = {
  Zef: string;
  Tal: string;
};

export interface WorldProtocol {
  reset(): WorldStateHandle;
  applyOperation(
    state: WorldStateHandle,
    operationDisplayName: string
  ): { success: true; newState: WorldStateHandle } | { success: false; error: string };
  getEntityState(state: WorldStateHandle, entityDisplayName: string): string;
  toAbstractSnapshot(state: WorldStateHandle): Record<string, string>;
}

const initialState: WorldStateHandle = {
  Zef: "idle",
  Tal: "idle",
};

const kindle = (
  state: WorldStateHandle,
  entities: Partial<WorldStateHandle>
): WorldStateHandle => ({
  ...state,
  ...entities,
});

export const protocol: WorldProtocol = {
  reset(): WorldStateHandle {
    return { ...initialState };
  },

  applyOperation(state, operationDisplayName) {
    switch (operationDisplayName) {
      case "kindleZef":
        return { success: true, newState: kindle(state, { Zef: "pex" }) };
      case "kindleTal":
        return { success: true, newState: kindle(state, { Tal: "pex" }) };
      case "kindleBoth":
        return {
          success: true,
          newState: kindle(state, { Zef: "pex", Tal: "pex" }),
        };
      default:
        return {
          success: false,
          error: `Unknown operation: ${operationDisplayName}`,
        };
    }
  },

  getEntityState(state, entityDisplayName) {
    if (entityDisplayName === "Zef") {
      return state.Zef;
    }
    if (entityDisplayName === "Tal") {
      return state.Tal;
    }
    return "unknown";
  },

  toAbstractSnapshot(state) {
    return {
      Zef: state.Zef,
      Tal: state.Tal,
    };
  },
};
"}],"workingNote":"protocol の公開メソッド署名を維持し、kindleBoth は元の状態を変更せず Zef/Tal を同一の新状態で pex に設定します。既存想定の個別 kindle 操作も保持し、不明な操作は失敗として返します。"}

